At an ambient temperature of 33-35 degrees Celsius, 
UniFLEX encounters disk structure issues.

If a "blockcheck" frequently reveals problems, 
it is time to replace the 74LS461 chips on the IDE card 
with GAL22V10D-15 chips using the GALUx-461.jed code.

See the FLEX section.
However, with FLEX, the issues were only observed on a 5 MHz bus,
UniFLEX performs continuous read and write operations on the disk.

